    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A comprehensive insurance cover protects against loss, theft, or damage during transit. The policy should list the insured value, coverage limits, and claim procedures. For corporate travel budgets and government procurement guidelines, a valid insurance policy is non‑negotiable and often a mandatory attachment to reimbursement forms.</p>
