<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Chapra | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting Bihar
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad guarantee a scratch‑free arrival for my bike during transportation from Chapra?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a seven‑layer shock‑absorbent packing system, hydraulic ramp loading, and enclosed container trucks equipped with wheel chocks and high‑tensile lashings. Combined with 100% IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance, any damage claim is processed within 48 hours, ensuring your bike reaches its destination without a single scratch.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the exact steps to book a bike transportation service in Chapra and receive a quote?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">First, provide bike details and pickup address via our web form or call center. Second, our logistics team calculates distance, bike type, and insurance needs, then sends an itemized quote instantly. Third, you confirm the booking, schedule a doorstep pickup, and receive a GST‑compliant invoice for seamless reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my bike fully insured for the 850 km journey from Chapra to major transport hubs?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment under Bike Transportation In Chapra includes full‑coverage, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering declared value up to 100 % of the bike’s market price. The policy protects against loss, theft, accidental damage, and natural hazards throughout the entire transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I monitor my bike’s location in real time while it travels from Chapra to the destination?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our enclosed container trucks are fitted with satellite‑GPS units that feed live coordinates to a secure customer portal. You receive instant alerts at each major checkpoint, and a dedicated support line is available 24/7 for any queries.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation do I need for GST billing and corporate reimbursement for bike transport from Chapra?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will receive an IBA‑approved GST invoice, a compliant e‑Way bill, the mover code certificate, and a copy of the insurance policy. These documents satisfy the requirements of Central and State government departments, PSUs, and private corporations for hassle‑free reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do cruiser and sports bikes receive special handling compared to standard motorcycles?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Cruiser and sports bikes are secured on custom‑fit wooden crates with additional foam edge protectors and reinforced ratchet lashings. The hydraulic ramp is adjusted for heavier frames, and we allocate dedicated space in the container to prevent movement, ensuring premium protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading system improve safety over traditional loading methods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp provides a smooth, level incline that eliminates manual lifting, reducing the risk of drops or impact. It allows precise alignment of the bike’s wheels with chocks, ensures even weight distribution, and speeds up loading, making it the safest method for Bike Transportation In Chapra.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
